# Photographs are WebP

Save page photos as `.webp` in `assets/img/` and reference `.webp` in PHP, CSS, and JS. Do not add `.jpg` photographs.

- Home: `g-*.webp`
- Line pages: `l-<key>-a.webp` through `l-<key>-g.webp`
- Tab icon: `favicon.webp`
- Apple home-screen icon stays `favicon.png`
